B.Vg=new A.ah("How do I match with someone?",'Open the Home tab and tap the big "Match me now" button. Pick a topic, then wait while we pair you with another learner.')
B.UV=new A.ah("How long is a round?","Each round is 5 minutes. When the timer ends, you'll both get a chance to rate the chat.")
B.UQ=new A.ah("How do I become friends with someone?","After a match, rate the session 4 stars or higher. If your partner does the same, you'll automatically become friends.")
B.Ve=new A.ah("Is my video saved?","No. LangLoop uses peer-to-peer WebRTC \u2014 your video never touches our servers.")
B.UX=new A.ah("How do I delete my account?","Go to Profile \u2192 Delete my account. Your data is anonymized within seconds.")
B.V2=new A.ah("Why was I banned?","Bans happen after reports of abuse, nudity, or hate speech. If you believe this was a mistake, email support@langloop.app.")
B.Oq=s([B.Vg,B.UV,B.UQ,B.Ve,B.UX,B.V2],t.Wy)
